ds / feet no longer oversized, hair hidden under the helm, cape physics, horse seat at WoW's rider height + saved seat slider, paladin auras / DK presences on the stance bar, spellbook tabs, loot roll item tooltip, auto dismount to attack, weapon put away for ranged casts and on mount-up, hand effects follow the combat animation, Stormwind's floating cathedral copy hidden, NPC helmets and shoulders). Iteration 11.2 (Armour Adjustment per piece + helm in photos, immersive armour Full (experimental), WoW minimap top right on desktop, shared origin so nearby Somnium avatars and voice work, other players' jumps, VR 50% target laser, strike ring size / spread / height and a 0.3 s swing cooldown, the strike ring floats with you, sheathed weapons, floors, quest-box socket, death aura cleared). Iteration 11.1 (fixes after the first test: forms hide every avatar copy, elite frames, WoW cursors, sell cursor, rank upgrade on bars, spell sound lengths, live portraits, ships carry like Somnium elevators, desktop walk by default). Iteration 11 (Complete): vendors (buy, sell, buy back, repair), WoW's bags and bank (drag between slots, drag out to destroy), trainers, skills and professions, talents and glyphs, Character / Reputation / Currency / Achievement windows, friends, guilds, charters, mail, chat channels and emotes, trade, duels, inspect, follow, raids, ready checks, raid icons, PvP flag, summons, Auction House, battlegrounds, Dungeon Finder, flight paths, ships and zeppelins online, Charge and knockbacks moving the avatar, ground spells with the green circle, ground areas and weapon enchant glows, instances (area triggers, only your group inside), pets, totems, stables, vehicles and possession, forms and polymorph on the Somnium avatar, WoW full-body combat animation (desktop), immersive armour (helm + shoulders, off by default), four extra action bars + stance bar, VR rows (push / pull with grip), VR spell slotting, immersive strike (off by default), the Elwynn corpse quest and a more reliable corpse run, WoW panel rules / cursor / Escape order on desktop. Offline: vendors, class trainers, talents, emotes, Charge / Blink / Disengage, ground spells.";
